# The Bishop's third class node: an orb thrown forward that hits as it drifts,
# then bursts into a light that hits wider and gives the party a buff.
#
# GMS's tooltip has two sixes, and they mean different things. `mobCount` is the
# six enemies each beat reaches. The "Max Contact Count: 6" beside it is a
# separate budget, and the next sentence says only the healing uses it. So
# contacts limit how many party members the orb heals, not how often it hits.
#
# How often it hits isn't published. The beat is GMS's `attackDelay`, 350ms. The
# count of three is the community DPM calculator's, and the orb's speed agrees:
# 600 pixels at `v 12`, six times slower than the F/P's projectiles, keeps a
# 220-pixel orb over a boss for about three beats.
#
# The buff is final damage: Holy Light is its own skill, 400021077, and states
# it as `indieDamR`. Twelve seconds on a ten-second cooldown means the Bishop
# keeps it up permanently, which is the point; namu has a Bishop casting this
# every ten seconds as the core of the rotation.
#
# The orb and the light both land when the cast ends. GMS first flies the orb
# out over three quarters of a second, and nothing here has room to fly.
#
# The three beats land together instead of on their own clock. A swing split by
# `cast_interval_ms` repeats all of itself on every beat, and this swing
# includes the light, so splitting would burst the light three times. The map
# doesn't change in those 700ms anyway.
#
# Dropped: the 350 MP (not tracked), the recast that dismisses an orb already
# out (pointless on a ten-second cooldown), and immunity to attack reflection,
# which nothing here has.
name: "Peacemaker"
description:
  "Hurl the embodiment of divine power directly at your enemies. Upon contact "
  "the power both damages them and restores your HP. As it disappears the "
  "object transforms into Holy Light, attacking enemies nearby and granting a "
  "buff to party members."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ATTACK
tags: SKILL_TAG_HOLY
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP_V skill_order: 3 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
required_equip_type: EQUIP_TYPE_STAFF
base_delay_ms: 660
cooldown_seconds: 10.0
max_enemies: 6
lines: 4
casts: 3
base {
  skill_pct: 3.64
  hp_recover_pct: 0.45
}
per_level { skill_pct: 0.14 }
extra_hit {
  label: "Holy Light"
  max_enemies: 15
  lines: 12
  base { skill_pct: 3.64 }
  per_level { skill_pct: 0.14 }
}
buff {
  duration_seconds: 12.0
  base { final_dmg_pct: 0.172 }
  per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.002 }
  ally_base { final_dmg_pct: 0.172 }
  ally_per_level { final_dmg_pct: 0.002 }
}
